      "comment": "Multiple Group 1 winner FATE AWAITS (3) has been freshened since the winter carnival when he missed narrowly in his latest outing in the 4YO Championship after a second to subsequent Inter Dominion winner Captains Mistress. Has had seven weeks off but is very well placed aided by a good draw. WILLIAMS (1) has produced a series of close up efforts since a win from the back row. Good effort to come from a wide barrier for a 2.2m second last week so he is better served by the ace draw. MAJOR CRUNCH (7) draws wide but has been solid from the back row of late. Can feature with even luck as can SEASIDE GLORY (9) who draws on the second line but comes off a decent midfield effort in the Triad 4M final.",
